  "description": {
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Echinochloa crus-pavonis",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Echinochloa_crus-pavonis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1314089091,
      "text": "Echinochloa crus-pavonis is a species of grass known by the common name gulf cockspur grass. It is native to much of the Americas, Africa, and part of Asia, and it is known throughout the world as an introduced species. It is an annual grass often exceeding 1.5 meters in maximum height. The inflorescence is divided into several branches coated in green spikelets."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Capim-arroz",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Capim-arroz",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 63534357,
      "text": "O Capim-arroz planta de até 1,4 metro, da família das gramíneas, entouceirada, herbácea e ereta, de folhas glabras, planas e estriadas, daninha à agricultura. Também é conhecido pelos nomes de barbudinho, capim-jaú, capituva e gervão."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Echinochloa crus-pavonis",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Echinochloa_crus-pavonis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29432213,
      "text": "Echinochloa crus-pavonis adalah spesies rumput yang dikenal dengan nama umum gulf cockspur grass. Tumbuhan ini merupakan tumbuhan asli dari sebagian besar wilayah Amerika, Afrika, dan sebagian Asia, serta dikenal di seluruh dunia sebagai spesies introduksi. Ini adalah rumput semusim yang sering kali melebihi tinggi 1,5 meter. Perbungaannya terbagi menjadi beberapa cabang yang dilapisi oleh bulir-bulir kecil berwarna hijau."
    }
  },
